---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import photo1 from '@/assets/images/about/how-it-started/photo-1.png';
import photo2 from '@/assets/images/about/how-it-started/photo-2.png';
---

<section class="relative overflow-x-clip py-15 md:py-30" aria-labelledby="how-it-started-heading">
  <div class="container flex flex-col items-center gap-10 xl:flex-row xl:items-center xl:justify-between xl:gap-27.5">
    <div class="@container relative aspect-610/515 w-full max-w-152.5 shrink-0">
      <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 h-128.75 w-152.5 origin-top-left transform-[scale(calc(100cqw/610px))]">
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 flex h-[422.6px] w-[383.7px] items-center justify-center">
          <figure class="bg-cream -rotate-10 flex w-81 items-center rounded-sm px-3 pt-3 pb-15 shadow-[0_4px_7.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)]">
            <div class="relative size-75 overflow-hidden rounded-sm">
              <Image src={photo1} alt="An early Crew419 mission team standing together with local children" width={600} height={600} class="size-full object-cover" />
            </div>
          </figure>
        </div>

        <div class="absolute top-[111.4px] left-[249.3px] z-10 flex h-[403.8px] w-[361.1px] items-center justify-center">
          <figure class="bg-cream rotate-6 flex w-81 items-center rounded-sm px-3 pt-3 pb-15 shadow-[0_4px_7.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)]">
            <div class="relative size-75 overflow-hidden rounded-sm">
              <Image src={photo2} alt="Kevin Grubinski with fellow missionaries in the Dominican Republic" width={600} height={600} class="size-full object-cover" />
            </div>
          </figure>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex w-full max-w-169 flex-col items-start gap-10">
      <div class="flex w-full flex-col items-start gap-3.75">
        <p class="text-muted-foreground text-base leading-none font-bold uppercase">How it started</p>
        <h2 id="how-it-started-heading" class="text-3xl leading-[1.1] font-bold md:text-5xl">The Beginning of Crew419</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="flex w-full max-w-137.5 flex-col items-start gap-7.5 text-foreground">
        <p class="text-base leading-none">
          Crew419 was founded with one simple conviction: every believer is called to live on mission. After years of serving internationally and leading mission teams, Kevin Grubinski saw the need
          for an organization that would do more than organize trips. He wanted to prepare people spiritually, connect them with trusted local ministries, and help them continue living on mission long
          after returning home.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg leading-none font-medium">
          Today, Crew419 partners with churches, schools, and ministry leaders to create meaningful short-term mission experiences that are centered on discipleship, service, and lasting Kingdom
          impact.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
